<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=utf-8" />
    <style>
      /* Email styling */
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f4; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 20px auto; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); }
      .header { background-color: #4f46e5; color: #ffffff; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; text-align: center; }
      .content { padding: 20px; color: #333333; line-height: 1.6; }
      .button { display: inline-block; background-color: #4f46e5; color: #ffffff; padding: 10px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; margin-top: 20px; }
      .footer { text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #777777; margin-top: 20px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h2>Regulation Review Assignment</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="content">
        <p>Hello <%= @user.full_name %>,</p>
        <p>A regulation review has been assigned to you for the <strong><%= @new_state %></strong> step.</p>
        <p><strong>Regulation:</strong> <%= @regulation_review.organization_regulation.regulation.title %></p>
        <p>Please review the regulation and take the necessary action.</p>
        <p>
          <%= link_to "View Review", regulation_review_url(@regulation_review), class: "button" %>
        </p>
        <p>Thank you,</p>
        <p>The Compliance Tracker Team</p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        <p>&copy; <%= Time.current.year %> Compliance Tracker. All rights reserved.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
